      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      416.23,
      286.38,
      481.51
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice under Sub section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the land Acquisition (amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, That the Government intends to acquire the following land/Servitude which is required for a public purpose:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      483.24,
      277.08,
      501.17
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land or Servitude to be Acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldItal",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      502.64,
      286.44,
      581.6
    ],
    "text": "The land allotment called Kulaielanthai in total extent of about 3.0266 Hectares depicted as Lot No. 1 in Plan No. MN 780 and prepared by Surveyor General situated in the village called Nadukkuda, in the Grama Niladari Division No. 54 of Tullukkudiyiruppu, in the Divisional Secretary's division of Mannar Town of Mannar district in Northern Province:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      583.04,
      286.44,
      639.2
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 1 Name of the Land: Kulaielanthai; Present use of land : Bare land; Claimant: Government; Original Claimant: -; Extent : 3.0266 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      4.079591751098633,
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      346.15,
      539.65,
      418.4
    ],
    "text": "The dates and the time of the inquiries; All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at 10.00 a.m. on the 15th day of February 2019 at Mannar Town Divisional Secretariat.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      4.079591751098633,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.32,
      419.84,
      539.6,
      510.32
    ],
    "text": "And further you are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 08th day of February 2019 the nature of their interest in the land, the particulars of their claims for the compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
